data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","messageId":"20c12a7199be48e3be258e0b8f35891c","toolCallId":"toolu_013xwguLeKkVTqs5YjXMd94C","role":"tool","content":"{\n  \"id\": 210,\n  \"name\": \"Ecosystems (Ecuador module)\",\n  \"description_short\": \"The 51 ecosystem classes present in the Ecuadorian Amazon module, from the Ecosystem Map of Continental Ecuador (characterised for 2012).\",\n  \"description\": \"### Ecosystems\\n\\nVector component derived from the official Ecosystem cartography of Continental Ecuador. The source characterises ecosystems as of 2012 and was published as geographic information in 2013, at 1:100,000 scale, using biophysical modelling, interpretation of 2010-2012 satellite imagery and field validation.\\n\\nThis layer is not a wall-to-wall land cover and use map. Areas without a polygon are not a category called \\\"non-ecosystem\\\" and are not equivalent to \\\"non-forest\\\"; transformed surfaces or anthropic uses must be read from a dedicated land cover component.\\n\\n### Data source & methodology\\n\\nMinistry of Environment and Energy, IDE Ambiente / Interactive Map. 790 invalid geometries in the ECU_MOD calculation extent were repaired, precision was reduced to a common 90 m grid (three steps of the original 30 m grid), and patches were dissolved by ecosystem code. Thematic attributes are constant per ecosystem code, so the dissolve removes record fragmentation without removing thematic variation. Exact clip by ECU_MOD, reprojection to WGS 84 (EPSG:4326), geodesic area recalculated last.\\n\\n### Specific content of the layer\\n\\nEcosystem code and name, ecosystem type, physiognomy, fragility, threat, vulnerability, fragmentation, connectivity, and area in hectares and square kilometres. Fragility, threat, vulnerability, fragmentation and connectivity are source attributes; the processing does not recalculate or update them.\\n\\n### Technical details\\n\\n91,347 source polygons, 87 ecosystem codes, EPSG:32717. Inside ECU_MOD: 51 classes (36 forest, 6 shrubland, 9 herbaceous physiognomy; 48 terrestrial, 3 aquatic types), 10,767,901.75 ha / 107,679.02 km², 2,533,992 vertices, 0 invalid geometries. Area variation from the generalisation step was about -0.00108%. For patch boundaries at source resolution, use the original ZIP.\\n\\n### References & access links\\n\\nOfficial dictionary GE000_ECOSISTEMA; IDE Ambiente Interactive Map, https://ide.ambiente.gob.ec/mapainteractivo/\",\n  \"subtopic\": 5,\n  \"unit\": \"ha\",\n  \"country\": \"ECU\",\n  \"resource\": {\n    \"type\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://services6.arcgis.com/sROlVM0rATIYgC6a/arcgis/rest/services/l_11_ecosistemas_del_modulo_ecuador/FeatureServer\",\n    \"layer_id\": 0\n  },\n  \"value_type\": \"categorical\",\n  \"aggregation\": \"none\",\n  \"decimals\": null,\n  \"spatial_coverage\": [\n    \"ECU\"\n  ],\n  \"collected_at_level\": null,\n  \"sensitivity\": \"public\",\n  \"ai_answerable\": true,\n  \"caveats\": [],\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"source_org\": null,\n    \"source_url\": null,\n    \"license\": null,\n    \"source_citation\": null,\n    \"data_vintage\": null,\n    \"update_cadence\": null,\n    \"method_url\": null\n  },\n  \"category_field\": \"Ecosistema\",\n  \"covers_module\": false,\n  \"documented_count\": null,\n  \"sync\": {\n    \"arcgis_item_id\": \"1108a9956a9b4076931c5a35e9decf3a\",\n    \"queryable_fields\": [\n      \"fid\",\n      \"Codigo_ecosistema\",\n      \"Ecosistema\",\n      \"Tipo_ecosistema\",\n      \"Fisonomia\",\n      \"Fragilidad\",\n      \"Amenaza\",\n      \"Vulnerabilidad\",\n      \"Fragmentacion\",\n      \"Conectividad\",\n      \"Area_ha\",\n      \"Area_km2\",\n      \"Shape__Area\",\n      \"Shape__Length\"\n    ],\n    \"layer_last_edit\": \"2026-08-19T09:57:43.622000Z\",\n    \"schema_last_edit\": \"2026-08-19T09:57:43.622000Z\",\n    \"item_modified\": \"2026-09-14T21:55:27Z\",\n    \"synced_at\": \"2026-09-30T13:48:00Z\",\n    \"sync_status\": \"ok\",\n    \"published_count\": 51,\n    \"pixel_size_deg\": null\n  },\n  \"available\": true,\n  \"record_counts\": null\n}"}

